      <link>https://www.aajkaal.in/sports/suryakumar-yadav-enjoyed-a-post-match-mutton-curry-feast-with-sarfaraz-khan-after-heroics-in-the-syed-mushtaq-ali-trophy-520626</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.aajkaal.in/sports/suryakumar-yadav-enjoyed-a-post-match-mutton-curry-feast-with-sarfaraz-khan-after-heroics-in-the-syed-mushtaq-ali-trophy-520626</guid>
